    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333350/extras/148c299e8610ec18bd87a5c53ec3918e.poster.avif?t=1739826708\" width=750 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333350/extras/148c299e8610ec18bd87a5c53ec3918e.webm?t=1739826708\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333350/extras/148c299e8610ec18bd87a5c53ec3918e.mp4?t=1739826708\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> After resisting your abusers and losing your hands in the process, they saw only one option\u2014to lock you away in a bare room, a form of mental torture. The room is completely empty. No furniture, no wallpapers, nothing but blank walls, forcing you to confront the overwhelming void and loneliness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In an attempt to fill this emptiness, you start drawing on the walls. But do you truly understand what you\u2019re creating?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then, one day, a voice speaks to you\u2014not through dreams, but directly in your mind. Her name is Mina, or at least you think it is. She tells you to escape, unlocking the doors and setting you free, but offers no explanation. Is this a trap? Can you trust her?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s only one way to find out. <strong>Use your head carefully.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333350/extras/1b6bd971a8c24a485983eccaeca9c4ba.poster.avif?t=1739826708\" width=750 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333350/extras/1b6bd971a8c24a485983eccaeca9c4ba.webm?t=1739826708\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333350/extras/1b6bd971a8c24a485983eccaeca9c4ba.mp4?t=1739826708\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging rooms where you need to bypass all obstacles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have unique battle mechanics\u2014The head acts as the sword, and dodging serves as the shield, but you have to time it right.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unravel the stories and mysteries that the game has to offer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your characters with amazing hats\u2014some hats are just hard to get...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat doesn't require killing\u2014but sometimes, things take a darker turn.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring original traditional hand-drawn art and an amazing in-game soundtrack.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\"><strong>Never close your eyes</strong></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333350/extras/148c299e8610ec18bd87a5c53ec3918e.poster.avif?t=1739826708\" width=750 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333350/extras/148c299e8610ec18bd87a5c53ec3918e.webm?t=1739826708\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333350/extras/148c299e8610ec18bd87a5c53ec3918e.mp4?t=1739826708\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> After resisting your abusers and losing your hands in the process, they saw only one option\u2014to lock you away in a bare room, a form of mental torture. The room is completely empty. No furniture, no wallpapers, nothing but blank walls, forcing you to confront the overwhelming void and loneliness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In an attempt to fill this emptiness, you start drawing on the walls. But do you truly understand what you\u2019re creating?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then, one day, a voice speaks to you\u2014not through dreams, but directly in your mind. Her name is Mina, or at least you think it is. She tells you to escape, unlocking the doors and setting you free, but offers no explanation. Is this a trap? Can you trust her?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s only one way to find out. <strong>Use your head carefully.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333350/extras/1b6bd971a8c24a485983eccaeca9c4ba.poster.avif?t=1739826708\" width=750 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333350/extras/1b6bd971a8c24a485983eccaeca9c4ba.webm?t=1739826708\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333350/extras/1b6bd971a8c24a485983eccaeca9c4ba.mp4?t=1739826708\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging rooms where you need to bypass all obstacles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have unique battle mechanics\u2014The head acts as the sword, and dodging serves as the shield, but you have to time it right.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unravel the stories and mysteries that the game has to offer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your characters with amazing hats\u2014some hats are just hard to get...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat doesn't require killing\u2014but sometimes, things take a darker turn.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring original traditional hand-drawn art and an amazing in-game soundtrack.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\"><strong>Never close your eyes</strong></span></p>",
